    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17680,
        "title": "Instâncias",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149925,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vamos ver como as classes nos permitem criar muitos objetos de jogo semelhantes no início e depois alterá-los individualmente ao longo do tempo.</p><p>Vamos fazer isso examinando mais de perto os jogadores em um jogo que foram criados a partir de uma classe inicial.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149926,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Toda vez que criamos um objeto a partir de uma classe, estamos criando o que é chamado de <strong>instância</strong> dessa classe.</p><p>Crie uma instância da classe <code>Player</code> e armazene-a na constante <code>player1</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"117\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Arya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>new</code> seguido de <code>Player</code> e depois <code>(</code>, <code>\"Arya\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149927,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cada instância é independente. Isso significa que quando criamos uma nova instância, ela <em>não</em> afeta nenhuma outra instância.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Arya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bran&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player2);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"131\" /><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"153\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const player2</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>new Player(\"Bran\");</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149928,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><em>Mudar</em> uma instância também não afeta nenhuma outra instância.</p><p>Defina <code>player1.health</code> para <code>0</code> para ver como alterar uma propriedade de <code>player1</code> não afeta as propriedades de <code>player2</code>.<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"135\" endIndex=\"136\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Arya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player1.health = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bran&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player2);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149929,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Porque as instâncias são independentes, elas nos permitem acompanhar dados complicados, como um grande número de inimigos em um jogo.<br /></p><p>Neste exemplo, acompanhamos quatro jogadores e sua saúde. Um jogo real pode acompanhar centenas de objetos.<br /></p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Arya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bran&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player3 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sansa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player4 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player2);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player3);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player4);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149930,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando nos referimos a uma instância de uma classe, do que estamos falando?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Um objeto de jogo específico criado a partir de um modelo de classe</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O template de classe a partir do qual criamos objetos de jogo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Um objeto de jogo específico criado a partir de um modelo de classe.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149931,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quantas instâncias podemos criar a partir de uma classe?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quantos quisermos</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Apenas um</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quantos quisermos.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149932,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se alterássemos as propriedades de uma instância, o que aconteceria com outras instâncias criadas a partir da mesma classe?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nada, eles não estão conectados um ao outro</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Todas as instâncias têm suas propriedades alteradas</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nada, eles não estão conectados um ao outro.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149933,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se mudássemos as propriedades de uma instância, o que aconteceria com a classe da qual ela foi criada?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nada, apenas a instância mudaria</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">As propriedades da classe também mudariam</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nada, apenas a instância mudaria.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149934,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie uma instância da classe <code>Enemy</code> e armazene-a na constante <code>slime</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"128\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" slime = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(slime);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>new</code> seguido de <code>Enemy</code> e finalmente <code>(\"slime\", 30)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149935,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie uma instância da classe <code>Enemy</code> e armazene-a na constante <code>goblin</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"145\" endIndex=\"148\" /><option startIndex=\"149\" endIndex=\"154\" /><option startIndex=\"154\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option startIndex=\"168\" endIndex=\"169\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" slime = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goblin = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(slime);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goblin);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>new</code> seguido de <code>Enemy</code> e depois <code>(\"goblin\", 50)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149936,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Defina <code>slime.health</code> para metade do seu valor.<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"190\" endIndex=\"202\" /><option startIndex=\"203\" endIndex=\"204\" /><option startIndex=\"205\" endIndex=\"217\" /><option startIndex=\"218\" endIndex=\"222\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" slime = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(slime);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goblin = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"slime.health = slime.health / \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goblin);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>slime.health</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e depois <code>slime.health</code>, <code>/ 2;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 149937,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione outro tipo de inimigo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"170\" endIndex=\"175\" /><option startIndex=\"176\" endIndex=\"182\" /><option startIndex=\"183\" endIndex=\"184\" /><option startIndex=\"185\" endIndex=\"188\" /><option startIndex=\"189\" endIndex=\"194\" /><option startIndex=\"194\" endIndex=\"209\" /><option startIndex=\"209\" endIndex=\"210\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(type, health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".type = type;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" slime = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" goblin = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dragon = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;dragon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(slime);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(goblin);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(dragon);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const</code> seguido de <code>dragon</code> e depois <code>=</code>, <code>new</code>, <code>Enemy</code>, <code>(\"dragon\", 300)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17681,
        "title": "Construtores",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149938,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Embora as instâncias comecem a partir do mesmo modelo de classe, elas podem se desenvolver de maneiras diferentes.<br /></p><p>Altere o status <code>isAlive</code> de <code>player1</code> e <code>player3</code> para refletir que eles foram derrotados.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"210\" endIndex=\"215\" /><option startIndex=\"235\" endIndex=\"240\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".isAlive = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bryn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player3 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Juno&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player1.isAlive = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player3.isAlive = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player2);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player3);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>false</code> seguido de <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149939,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mudar uma classe afeta <em>todas as instâncias</em> dessa classe.</p><p>Adicione uma propriedade <code>status</code> para que todos os jogadores tenham uma mensagem de status curta a partir de agora.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"92\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".isAlive = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".status = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ready for the next level&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Theon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player2.status);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>status</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149940,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ao mudar uma classe, podemos alterar tanto suas propriedades <em>quanto</em> seus <strong>métodos</strong>.</p><p>Chame o método <code>attack()</code> recém-adicionado que pertence à classe <code>Player</code> para ver como todas as instâncias de <code>Player</code> podem usá-lo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"237\" endIndex=\"245\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".isAlive = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; attacks!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Aria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Juno&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player1.attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player2.attack();}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>attack()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149941,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O construtor é o que cria uma instância. Mas ele não <em>sempre</em> precisa ter propriedades dentro dele. Ele funciona mesmo quando está <strong>vazio</strong>.<br /></p><p>Defina o método <code>constructor()</code> como vazio para esta classe <code>Enemy</code>. Isso significa que não há nada entre as chaves.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"this.hp = 100;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" growl() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Grrr!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy1.growl();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>{</code> seguido de <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149942,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Construtores são tão essenciais para classes que um <strong>construtor padrão</strong> é criado mesmo se não o adicionarmos.</p><p>Neste caso, a instância <code>enemy1</code> é criada com um construtor <em>padrão</em> vazio quando executamos o código.<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"100\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" growl() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Grrr!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy1.growl();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>enemy1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
